Subject: [selfhost 005] Two Stage 0 declaration spellings with no Stage 1 form

UTF8View.k: `fn op in (self)[iter] -> yield T`. The `[iter]` after the
receiver is Stage 0 only (S048E); Stage 1 spells the generator
`fn op in (self) -> yield T` (Spec/Docs control-flow, "for range and
iterator"). Lexer.k: `inline inline priv fn`, a doubled modifier that Stage 0
accepted and Stage 1 rejects (S048E).

